msgstr "名称为公共网格的位置。"

#: ../../../chemotools/adaptation/_x_axis_interpolator.py:docstring of
#: sklearn.utils._metadata_requests.RequestMethod.__get__.<locals>.func:1
msgid ""
"Configure whether metadata should be requested to be passed to the ``fit`` "
"method."
msgstr "配置是否请求将元数据传递给 ``fit`` 方法。"

#: ../../../chemotools/adaptation/_x_axis_interpolator.py:docstring of
#: sklearn.utils._metadata_requests.RequestMethod.__get__.<locals>.func:3
msgid ""
"Note that this method is only relevant when this estimator is used as a sub-"
"estimator within a :term:`meta-estimator` and metadata routing is enabled "
"with ``enable_metadata_routing=True`` (see :func:`sklearn.set_config`). "
"Please check the :ref:`User Guide <metadata_routing>` on how the routing "
"mechanism works."
msgstr ""
"请注意，仅当此估计器用作 :term:`meta-estimator` 中的子估计器，并通过 "
"``enable_metadata_routing=True`` 启用元数据路由时，此方法才有意义（参"
"见 :func:`sklearn.set_config`）。有关路由机制的工作方式，请查阅 :ref:`用户指"
"南 <metadata_routing>`。"

#: ../../../chemotools/adaptation/_x_axis_interpolator.py:docstring of
#: sklearn.utils._metadata_requests.RequestMethod.__get__.<locals>.func:9
msgid "The options for each parameter are:"
msgstr "每个参数可使用以下选项："

#: ../../../chemotools/adaptation/_x_axis_interpolator.py:docstring of
#: sklearn.utils._metadata_requests.RequestMethod.__get__.<locals>.func:11
msgid ""
"``True``: metadata is requested, and passed to ``fit`` if provided. The "
"request is ignored if metadata is not provided."
msgstr ""
"``True``：请求元数据；若已提供，则将其传给 ``fit``。若未提供元数据，则忽略该"
"请求。"

#: ../../../chemotools/adaptation/_x_axis_interpolator.py:docstring of
#: sklearn.utils._metadata_requests.RequestMethod.__get__.<locals>.func:13
msgid ""
"``False``: metadata is not requested and the meta-estimator will not pass it "
"to ``fit``."
msgstr "``False``：不请求元数据，元估计器不会将其传给 ``fit``。"

#: ../../../chemotools/adaptation/_x_axis_interpolator.py:docstring of
#: sklearn.utils._metadata_requests.RequestMethod.__get__.<locals>.func:15
msgid ""
"``None``: metadata is not requested, and the meta-estimator will raise an "
"error if the user provides it."
msgstr "``None``：不请求元数据；若用户提供元数据，元估计器将引发错误。"

#: ../../../chemotools/adaptation/_x_axis_interpolator.py:docstring of
#: sklearn.utils._metadata_requests.RequestMethod.__get__.<locals>.func:17
msgid ""
"``str``: metadata should be passed to the meta-estimator with this given "
"alias instead of the original name."
msgstr "``str``：元数据应使用给定别名而非原始名称传给元估计器。"

#: ../../../chemotools/adaptation/_x_axis_interpolator.py:docstring of
#: sklearn.utils._metadata_requests.RequestMethod.__get__.<locals>.func:19
msgid ""
"The default (``sklearn.utils.metadata_routing.UNCHANGED``) retains the "
"existing request. This allows you to change the request for some parameters "
"and not others."
msgstr ""
"默认值（``sklearn.utils.metadata_routing.UNCHANGED``）会保留现有请求。这样可"
"以只更改部分参数的请求，而不更改其他参数。"

